  "details": "So basically my avatars laying down animations are broken, I fold in on myself whenever I start moving around while laying down and going from standing to seated play makes me float off the ground for a second or 2 and just puts me back into standing. Im on quest and this only started happening after the update, but it has been happening on a smaller scale since 2020.3.2. I went through all of my avatars and all of them have some sort of animation issue when in prone idle, and I also haven’t found a fix for the seated play bug.",
